<title>USA: TABLE - Oglebay Norton Co Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Oglebay Norton Co Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>CONSOLIDATED STATEMENT OF OPERATIONS (UNAUDITED)</p>
<p>Oglebay Norton Company and Subsidiaries</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>						June 30	 June 30</p>
<p> (000's except per share amounts)  1997  1996   1997     1996</p>
<p>NET SALES AND OPERATING REVENUES</p>
<p>				    $50,586 $44,931  $70,995  $63,614</p>
<p>COSTS AND EXPENSES</p>
<p>Cost of goods sold and operating</p>
<p>   expenses			35,898  34,725   49,878   48,591</p>
