<p>     Net income per share	2.13     .93     2.48     1.73</p>
<p> Average number of shares     2,400   2,444    2,404    2,451</p>
<p>NOTE: In 1997, the company extended the estimated useful lives and increased the estimated salvage values for certain vessels in its fleet.  The effect of these changes in estimate reduced depreciation by $1,117,000 and increased net income by $737,000 ($.31 per share) for the three months and six months ended June 30, 1997.  The changes had no effect on the first quarter of 1997, as the Company's vessels are depreciated over the standard sailing season.  The changes in estimate will reduce depreciation by $3,178,000 and increase net income by $2,097,000 for the year ending December 31, 1997.</p>
<p>The Company's 1996 annual effective tax rate was reduced as a result  of a $1,824,000 state income tax refund received in the first quarter of  1996.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
